{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/10/4634050/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あつい～(´ω`๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もぽっかぽっかだ～ね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ほっぺた蚊に刺されちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっぺた赤くなっちゃって、なんか照れてるみたいだよー（泣）\n早く腫れよ、ひけぇ～(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、一日のシメに、アイスを食べるのがマイブームであります○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂上りに食べると、\nくはーっ！今日もアイスがうまい～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/10/4634050/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って一日の疲れが吹っ飛びます＾＾！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに今日は、一日中ライヴのレッスンで沢山、汗かいたから\nきっといつもより、アイスが美味しいはずだぞーっ(* ^o^ *)わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスの中でもバニラアイスが大スキ！\n毎日食べても飽きないっ∩^ω^∩♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは何アイスが好きかな？○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ！今日もアイスを食べて早寝するぞっ！┗(^o^ )┓<33ふぉっふ！ふぉっふ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/10/4634050/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これは中学生のときに描いた落書き。\nこんな絵も描けるんだよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/10/4634050/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、くまさんとカエルさんの何とも言えぬシュールさが好き(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！最後になっちゃったけど、\nあすかお誕生日おめでとう！(丿^ω^ヽ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最年少っ、でも、少しずつ成長していくあすかを見守っているよー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text